  "title": "Slow Cooker Chicken Gumbo with Shrimp",
  "description": "This crockpot gumbo features chicken thighs, shrimp, and veggies simmered with stewed tomatoes in a slow cooker for a no-fuss meal served over rice.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
  ],
